<title>THAILAND: Ayudhya Insurance 1996 net up slightly.</title>
<headline>Ayudhya Insurance 1996 net up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the</p>
<p>year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	    22.36	vs	  21.85</p>
<p>    Net			559.02	vs	 546.37</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Ayudhya Insurance Plc, an insurance company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
